  "description": "Beautiful two bed apartment in the centre of Georgian Dublin just off the canal. The apartment boasts a lovely sunny garden to the rear and private entrance with parking for one car behind gates. All new furniture, new boiler and redecoration just completed. This apartment has been finished to a very high standard, it has oak floors throughout with tiled bathrooms and kitchen floor. There is an integrated ventilation system and powered thermostatic showers with large water storage tanks. Gas fired central heating.. Fully fitted kitchen with dishwasher, large fridge freezer, washing machine and microwave.   Master bedroom with fitted cupboards and ensuite. Second double bedroom and bathroom.  Viewing is highly recommended",
